   "evidence": "Positivity.lean:238-244 states the bound only for `idxPlus idxMinus`; grep for `idxLong` in the file shows it appears only in `long`, `FLExact_nonneg`, `crossSectionBracket_nonneg` and the diagonal construction \u2014 no off-diagonal lemma touches it. `Matrix.PosSemidef.sq_apply_le` (PosSemidef.lean:152) already supplies the general tool, so the missing piece is purely the structure-function restatement.",
